schmeckts-server (1.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The server keeps any kind of data the app sends, named like the
    others, so a new kind in the app needs no new server; features in
    /api/info says so with "collections". The first is the app's
    observations.
  * /api/checksum?c= covers the collections named, and without it the
    three every app knows, so an older app still finds its data level.
  * The overview counts the entries of such collections.

